@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>
    EduBoost stores student names, roll numbers, class names, optional parent email addresses,
    attendance percentages, assessment marks and remedial plans in the local SQL Server LocalDB database.
</p>
<p>
    The data is used only for the academic project demonstration: identifying students who may need
    remedial support, suggesting teaching methods and tracking progress. Demo records are seeded
    automatically the first time the application runs.
</p>
